        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This _is_ documented in CONTRIBUTING.md, and looking at recent PRs would tell you how closely we still follow Vim. But hard and fast rules are impossible here so you'll always have to live with a posteriori decisions that take into account the exact code touched.\r\n\r\nRule of thumb:\r\n1. If it _can_ apply to Vim, it should first go to Vim.\r\n2. If you need to change (only) `oldtest`, it's shared code.",
